  "title": "Another conjecture about reloids and funcoids",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Definition $\\square f = \\bigcap^{\\mathsf{RLD}} \\mathrm{up}^{\\Gamma (\\operatorname{Src} f; \\operatorname{Dst} f)} f$ for reloid $f$.\n\nConjecture $(\\mathsf{RLD})_{\\Gamma} f = \\square (\\mathsf{RLD})_{\\mathrm{in}} f$ for every funcoid $f$.\n\nNote: it is known that $(\\mathsf{RLD})_{\\Gamma} f \\ne \\square (\\mathsf{RLD})_{\\mathrm{out}} f$ (see below mentioned online article).",
